      "message": "The naming is misleading (and i definitely misunderstood it) -- this refers to the additional space that needs to be made available on the partition to apply an update, right ? It\u0027s not the total amount of space that we\u0027d need to apply a payload is it ? I\u0027d suggest renaming.\n\nAlso, the contract of this method is pretty error prone as callers have to check the errorCode as well (in order to interpret it correctly). For example, if a caller doesn\u0027t check the error code, they may wrongly assume that no additional space is required (when the reality is that the method threw a ServiceSpecificException).\n\nCan we eliminate this somehow ?",
